      ]},
      { "t": "Day 4 · direction", "items": [
        { "k": "prf-d4-a", "en": "Learn the rule: prefix makes perfective, suffix makes imperfective." }
      ]},
      { "t": "Day 5 · dead prefixes", "items": [
